      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT FLAIR (7) produced a moderate performance last time when eighth at Warragul over 400m behind Lakeview Lynette (23.33) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money the start prior. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Key runner on his best form. MISS BOBBIE (6) was in winning form two back (22.46) at Shepparton but ran below best last time there, finishing 8th. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of six starts. One of the better hopes. ASTON ROCHELLE (1) has been out of the placings at her last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (16.90) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. DIM SIM RIXI (3) is a last start winner in very good time. Must include.",
